      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{6161a61a2c0de966b4e43486|full_name} I don't see any of /tracking/eye/[...] params in the OSC debug on the affected avatars, only /avatar/parameters/[...] . However the VRCFT software literally hasn't been updated since April 2024. And its not dependent on hardware either because both my Quest Pro and my iPhone via LiveLink exhibit the same behavior. So it must be some recent change on VRChat's side that is causing the VRCFT software to behave differently.\n\nAlso for the vrcft-enabled avatars I have double checked that it not related to the implementation, since avatars powered by Jerry's Templates and by Pawlygon both behave the same.",
